.TH sam-jail-group-restore 1 2026-11-23 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-group\-restore \- Undo a `group set`: reads the "undo" object it printed (JSON on stdin) and takes back only that change
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail group restore\fR [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Undo a `group set`: reads the "undo" object it printed (JSON on stdin) and takes back only that change
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Confirm an undo that adds something rated Think twice or Dangerous back
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
